  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div> <section id=\"release-2.0.1\" aria-labelledby=\"hd-ffffa4ed\" data-release-anchor=\"release-2.0.1\"> <h2 id=\"hd-ffffa4ed\">Desktop APP 2.0.1 (Beta Testing)</h2> <div data-pjax=\"true\" data-test-selector=\"body-content\" data-view-component=\"true\"><h2>Logseq 2.0 Beta (DB version) is here! 🎉</h2>\n<p>After a long wait, our first Logseq 2.0 beta release is finally here. We know many of you have been looking forward to trying it, and we’re excited to put it in your hands!</p>\n<p>This is an early beta, so you may encounter some rough edges. We’d love for you to give it a try and tell us what works, what doesn’t, and what you’d like to see next. Your feedback will help us improve Logseq and shape the stable release.</p>\n<p>Before getting started, please take a moment to read these updates:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://logseq.io/p/NX4mc_ggEV\" rel=\"nofollow\">Live roadmap</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://logseq.io/p/e3YDyX5AYr\" rel=\"nofollow\">Big update: Logseq is splitting into two versions</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>As with any beta, please back up your important data before testing. You can share feedback and report issues through our <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/db-test/issues\">GitHub issue tracker</a>.</p>\n<p>Thank you for your patience, encouragement, and continued support. We’re excited to begin this next chapter with you! ❤️</p></div> </section> <section id=\"release-nightly\" aria-labelledby=\"hd-6622a43b\" data-release-anchor=\"release-nightly\"> <h2 id=\"hd-6622a43b\">Desktop app Nightly Release 20260710</h2> <div data-view-component=\"true\"> <p>This is a nightly release of the Logseq desktop app.<br>\nIt's unstable compared to the official releases, <strong>use it with caution</strong>!</p>\n</div> </section> <section id=\"release-0.10.15\" aria-labelledby=\"hd-ec7243bb\" data-release-anchor=\"release-0.10.15\"> <h2 id=\"hd-ec7243bb\">Desktop/Android APP 0.10.15 (Beta Testing)</h2> <div data-pjax=\"true\" data-test-selector=\"body-content\" data-view-component=\"true\"><ul>\n<li>\n<h2>Beta 0.10.15 [[Dec 1st, 2025]]</h2>\nDesktop app and Android App download link: <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/releases/tag/0.10.15\">https://github.com/logseq/logseq/releases/tag/0.10.15</a>\n<ul>\n<li>[[Fixed issues]]\n<ul>\n<li>Fix: Youtube embeds not working</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Enhancement]]\n<ul>\n<li>Bump Electron to 38.4.0</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div> </section> <section id=\"release-0.10.14\" aria-labelledby=\"hd-7ff0a3ba\" data-release-anchor=\"release-0.10.14\"> <h2 id=\"hd-7ff0a3ba\">Desktop/Android APP 0.10.14 (Beta Testing)</h2> <div data-pjax=\"true\" data-test-selector=\"body-content\" data-view-component=\"true\"><p>Highlights:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Bump pdf.js to 4.2.67, thanks to <a href=\"https://github.com/Th-o-mas\">https://github.com/Th-o-mas</a><br>\nSecurity vulnerability (<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/security/advisories/GHSA-92h5-2358-7xjv\">GHSA-92h5-2358-7xjv</a>) with remote code execution has been closed.</li>\n<li>fix: match paste of x.com links for twitter <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3307206699\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/issues/12043\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/12043/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/12043\">#12043</a></li>\n</ol></div> </section> <section id=\"release-0.10.13\" aria-labelledby=\"hd-5c31e06e\" data-release-anchor=\"release-0.10.13\"> <h2 id=\"hd-5c31e06e\">Desktop/Android APP 0.10.13 (Beta Testing)</h2> <div data-view-component=\"true\"> <p>Fix: Youtube embeds not working <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3296807620\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/issues/12031\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/issues/12031/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/issues/12031\">#12031</a></p>\n</div> </section> <section id=\"release-0.10.12\" aria-labelledby=\"hd-3871621e\" data-release-anchor=\"release-0.10.12\"> <h2 id=\"hd-3871621e\">Desktop/Android APP 0.10.12 (Beta Testing)</h2> <div data-pjax=\"true\" data-test-selector=\"body-content\" data-view-component=\"true\"><ul>\n<li>\n<h2>Beta 0.10.12 [[May 26th, 2025]]</h2>\nDesktop app and Android App download link: <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/releases/tag/0.10.12\">https://github.com/logseq/logseq/releases/tag/0.10.12</a>\n<ul>\n<li>[[Fixed issues]]\n<ul>\n<li>App freeze, high CPU/GPU usage, and frequent diff prompts <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/issues/11880\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/issues/11880/hovercard\">#11880</a></li>\n<li>High CPU consumption <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/issues/11874\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/issues/11874/hovercard\">#11874</a></li>\n<li>Using GTK 2/3 and GTK 4 in the same process is not supported <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/issues/11873\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/issues/11873/hovercard\">#11873</a></li>\n<li>App crashes on Mac</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div> </section> <section id=\"release-0.10.11\" aria-labelledby=\"hd-5a4c3cb9\" data-release-anchor=\"release-0.10.11\"> <h2 id=\"hd-5a4c3cb9\">Desktop/Android APP 0.10.11 (Beta Testing)</h2> <div data-pjax=\"true\" data-test-selector=\"body-content\" data-view-component=\"true\"><ul>\n<li>Includes all changes from Beta 0.10.10 [[May 7th, 2025]] and fixes major regressions with it.</li>\n<li>[[Fixed Issues]]\n<ul>\n<li>Images and themes not working <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/issues/11846\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/issues/11846/hovercard\">#11486</a></li>\n<li>Global search in blocks not working <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/issues/11851\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/issues/11851/hovercard\">#11851</a>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NOTE</strong>: You may need to run the command <code>Rebuild search index</code> for this fix.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Drag and drop of pdfs not working <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/issues/11850\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/issues/11850/hovercard\">#11850</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Enhancement]]\n<ul>\n<li>Upgrade Electron to 36.2.0</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/compare/0.10.9...0.10.11\"><tt>0.10.9...0.10.11</tt></a></p></div> </section> <section id=\"release-0.10.9\" aria-labelledby=\"hd-23c8aa7b\" data-release-anchor=\"release-0.10.9\"> <h2 id=\"hd-23c8aa7b\">Desktop/Android APP 0.10.9 (Beta Testing)</h2> <div data-pjax=\"true\" data-test-selector=\"body-content\" data-view-component=\"true\"><ul>\n<li>[[Thanks]]\n<ul>\n<li>[[desk7]]\n<ul>\n<li>Update Italian translation in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11179\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11179/hovercard\">#11179</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[KaMeHb-UA]]\n<ul>\n<li>Add Linux ARM64 build support in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11183\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11183/hovercard\">#11183</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Sun-Wukung]]\n<ul>\n<li>Update tutorial-sk.md in <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2239767314\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/issues/11226\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11226/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11226\">#11226</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[thief-sty]]\n<ul>\n<li>Update docs/develop-logseq.md in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11218\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11218/hovercard\">#11218</a></li>\n<li>Fix e2e-test command in <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11217\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11217/hovercard\">#11217</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Fixed issues]]\n<ul>\n<li>Fix missing refs for property text values when creating a page&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11208\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11208/hovercard\">#11208</a></li>\n<li>Fix incorrect behavior of the delete key for deleting the last char&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11190\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11190/hovercard\">#11190</a></li>\n<li>Fix missing default colors for highlight mark tag&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11247\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11247/hovercard\">#11247</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Enhancement]]\n<ul>\n<li>New block placeholder should accept tab and enter key&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11255\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11255/hovercard\">#11255</a></li>\n<li>Restore App window at current workspace&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11246\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11246/hovercard\">#11246</a></li>\n<li>I18n: Italian&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11179\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11179/hovercard\">#11179</a>, Slovak <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11226\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11226/hovercard\">#11226</a></li>\n<li>Linux ARM64 build support&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11183\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11183/hovercard\">#11183</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/compare/0.10.8...0.10.9\"><tt>0.10.8...0.10.9</tt></a></p></div> </section> <section id=\"release-0.10.8\" aria-labelledby=\"hd-045cbc07\" data-release-anchor=\"release-0.10.8\"> <h2 id=\"hd-045cbc07\">Desktop/Android APP 0.10.8 (Beta Testing)</h2> <div data-pjax=\"true\" data-test-selector=\"body-content\" data-view-component=\"true\"><ul>\n<li>[[Thanks]]\n<ul>\n<li>[[albanobattistella]]\n<ul>\n<li>Update Italian translation in <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11154\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11154/hovercard\">#11154</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[e-zz]]\n<ul>\n<li>Fix shift+mouse click on PDF View not invoking area highlight on Linux in <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10973\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10973/hovercard\">#10973</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Liu Cheng]]\n<ul>\n<li>Fix missing newline after multiline block when exporting a page&nbsp;in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10934\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10934/hovercard\">#10934</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Jon Ramos]]\n<ul>\n<li>Fix toggling of task list in <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11079\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11079/hovercard\">#11079</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[liymike]]\n<ul>\n<li>Update Simplified Chinese) translation in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11119\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11119/hovercard\">#11119</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[queeup]]\n<ul>\n<li>Update Turkish translation&nbsp;in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11063\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11063/hovercard\">#11063</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[yannicka]]\n<ul>\n<li>Remove obsolete \"@tailwindcss/line-clamp\" dependency in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11130\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11130/hovercard\">#11130</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Fixed issues]]\n<ul>\n<li>Fix toggling of task list <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11079\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11079/hovercard\">#11079</a></li>\n<li>Missing newline after multiline block when exporting a page <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10934\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10934/hovercard\">#10934</a></li>\n<li>Incorrect cursor move for the emoji from the line head <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11112\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11112/hovercard\">#11112</a></li>\n<li>Shift+mouse click on PDF View not invoking area highlight on Linux <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10973\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10973/hovercard\">#10973</a></li>\n<li>Fine tune page title search strategy <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11147\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11147/hovercard\">#11147</a></li>\n<li>Logout and clear keys for Logseq Sync <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11111\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11111/hovercard\">#11111</a></li>\n<li>Fix ui button component's click handling <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11068\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11068/hovercard\">#11068</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Enhancement]]\n<ul>\n<li>I18n: Simplified Chinese <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11119\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11119/hovercard\">#11119</a>, Turkish <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11063\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11063/hovercard\">#11063</a>, Italian <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11154\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11154/hovercard\">#11154</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/compare/0.10.7...0.10.8\"><tt>0.10.7...0.10.8</tt></a></p></div> </section> <section id=\"release-0.10.7\" aria-labelledby=\"hd-e058ef42\" data-release-anchor=\"release-0.10.7\"> <h2 id=\"hd-e058ef42\">Desktop/Android APP 0.10.7 (Beta Testing)</h2> <div data-pjax=\"true\" data-test-selector=\"body-content\" data-view-component=\"true\"><ul>\n<li>[[Thanks]]\n<ul>\n<li>[[Mostafa Ahangarha]]\n<ul>\n<li>Add partial Persian translation in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10938\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10938/hovercard\">#10938</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Vladimir Pouzanov]]\n<ul>\n<li>Fix :graph/current usage in the electron state in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11013\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11013/hovercard\">#11013</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Puneeth Chaganti]]\n<ul>\n<li>Fix typo in mldoc package name&nbsp;in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10995\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10995/hovercard\">#10995</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Tobias Domhan]]\n<ul>\n<li>Fix preserve root node block refs when cutting + pasting&nbsp;in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10841\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10841/hovercard\">#10841</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Topher Hunt]]\n<ul>\n<li>Add new keybinding for \"toggle expand/collapse this block\"&nbsp;in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10980\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10980/hovercard\">#10980</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[YU000jp]]\n<ul>\n<li>Fix main scrollbar jumps in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10037\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10037/hovercard\">#10037</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Fixed issues]]\n<ul>\n<li>Add .heic to media type <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11017\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11017/hovercard\">#11017</a></li>\n<li>Preserve root node block refs when cutting + pasting. <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10841\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10841/hovercard\">#10841</a></li>\n<li>Fix main scrollbar jumps <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10037\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10037/hovercard\">#10037</a></li>\n<li>Fix wrong <code>:command/toggle-favorite</code> handling in config <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10998\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10998/hovercard\">#10998</a></li>\n<li>Fix search term query highlight performance <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11030\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11030/hovercard\">#11030</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>[[Enhancement]]\n<ul>\n<li>New keybinding for \"toggle expand/collapse this block\" <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10980\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10980/hovercard\">#10980</a></li>\n<li>I18n: Persian <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10938\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10938/hovercard\">#10938</a>,</li>\n<li>Add share/open asset file for Android App <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10977\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10977/hovercard\">#10977</a></li>\n<li>Enhance accent color related details <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10986\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10986/hovercard\">#10986</a></li>\n<li>refactoring dropdown/context menu with the new components <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10897\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10897/hovercard\">#10897</a></li>\n<li>Better handling for macOS scrollbar system setting of auto scrolling mode <a href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11048\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/11048/hovercard\">#11048</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/punchagan/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/punchagan\">@punchagan</a> made their first contribution in <a data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2128481902\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/issues/10995\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/logseq/logseq/pull/10995/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/10995\">#10995</a></li>\n<li><a data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/topherhunt/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" dat